# LF determinism for the signed release chain.
#
# Every entry below carries `-text` so Git performs NO end-of-line conversion
# on checkout or checkin: bytes on disk match bytes in the index exactly. That
# determinism is load-bearing for the OpenClash Guard signed bundle (generator
# emits dist/openclash-guard.sh -> verifier hashes -> signer signs -> detached
# .sig is bound to the exact byte stream). Any CRLF/LF drift inside that
# chain would invalidate the signature without changing semantics.
#
# Rules are intentionally exhaustive at this repository's current shape: any
# new top-level path or file extension must either be added here or be
# covered by an existing glob. Do NOT add a bare `*` or `* text=auto` rule —
# that would re-enable per-platform conversion and break the chain above.

# Meta / docs
/README.md      -text
/.gitattributes -text
*.md            -text
*.txt           -text

# Tree-wide pins
setup/**        -text
dist/**         -text
internal/**     -text
apps/**         -text
docs/**         -text
dns/**          -text
web/**          -text
rule/**         -text
cfg/**          -text
tests/**        -text
tools/**        -text
.github/**      -text

# Extensions
*.sh            -text
*.json          -text
*.yaml          -text
*.yml           -text
*.ini           -text
*.conf          -text
